  "description": "Vision Automation Framework (VAF) is a fluent test automation framework for .NET on top of Selenium WebDriver. Waits, visibility and interactability are handled for you, so tests read like the steps they describe. Requires a .NET Framework 4.7.2 test project with NUnit 3.",
